    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEAT ROOM</strong> is a first-person horror survival game. You play as Dimitry, a middle-aged man who lives in an Eastern European country and works the night shift at a meat packaging factory.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/e90ff1a738af152b746358c4364f7845.poster.avif?t=1749882561\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/e90ff1a738af152b746358c4364f7845.webm?t=1749882561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/e90ff1a738af152b746358c4364f7845.mp4?t=1749882561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>One night, strange and scary things start happening. Dimitry finds himself in a dangerous situation where he must try to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk through dark and quiet halls and discover the scary secrets hidden in this ordinary place. Can you help Dimitry survive the horrors of the MEAT ROOM?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/05aed18a9b8f5dba0fe9cdb9fac8fccc.poster.avif?t=1749882561\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/05aed18a9b8f5dba0fe9cdb9fac8fccc.webm?t=1749882561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/05aed18a9b8f5dba0fe9cdb9fac8fccc.mp4?t=1749882561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br><br>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and scary environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure and survival gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy atmosphere with tense moments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic sounds to increase fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that unfolds as you play<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795850/extras/c124bab2fc06d6e28263635041a791b6.avif?t=1749882561\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
